                        "sense_id": "851cbd0a-1542-325e-98ac-443eecad363d",
                        "entry_id": "a0269fc1-c349-3801-92f1-a1cd132af98f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To frighten or cause hesitation; to daunt, put off (usually used in the negative); to disconcert, to perturb."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "810e7ca9-94b0-4c59-a791-f2ebb5954832",
                                "sense_id": "851cbd0a-1542-325e-98ac-443eecad363d",
                                "text": "Jumping out of an airplane does not faze him, yet he is afraid to ride a roller coaster."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d4cb6fe-364a-4058-b74b-7c9d3b6ddab0",
                                "sense_id": "851cbd0a-1542-325e-98ac-443eecad363d",
                                "text": "But we're / Not getting anywhere. Nothing / fazes her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82d19609-3f4c-42bf-94b7-72eaf7bd0202",
                                "sense_id": "851cbd0a-1542-325e-98ac-443eecad363d",
                                "text": "In the dreary world / That we're living in / It's fashionable / To let nothing faze you"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1185bf1-5bca-4bb5-9d26-a869ce035c3f",
                                "sense_id": "851cbd0a-1542-325e-98ac-443eecad363d",
                                "text": "Some individuals \"can't hold their liquor\" and become thoroughly intoxicated on small amounts of alcohol which would not faze most social drinkers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98311232-267a-4f93-9fec-81dab4a92cc0",
                                "sense_id": "851cbd0a-1542-325e-98ac-443eecad363d",
                                "text": "He sticks it out even further in the scherzo, fazing the listener with displaced accents, and then inserting a malicious pause just when we seem to have found our feet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38116e72-66d5-44ed-9ce9-6585754a558a",
                                "sense_id": "851cbd0a-1542-325e-98ac-443eecad363d",
                                "text": "[Gareth] Southgate should be absolutely clear now that [Jordan] Pickford is not fazed by the big occasion but, on the flip-side, he might not be too thrilled his goalkeeper was involved so much."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
